WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.208
Matty, with only three wins

00:00:01.208 --> 00:00:02.083
I don’t feel safe

00:00:02.083 --> 00:00:03.291
We have no defense

00:00:03.291 --> 00:00:04.208
Don’t worry, Julio

00:00:04.208 --> 00:00:05.458
after the incident

00:00:05.458 --> 00:00:08.125
I created a state-of-the-art panic room!

00:00:08.125 --> 00:00:10.250
Wow, I can freak out about not scoring here!

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:11.583
Are you always stressing

00:00:11.583 --> 00:00:13.416
that your 30-point games aren’t enough?

00:00:13.416 --> 00:00:15.666
You need a panic room today

00:00:15.666 --> 00:00:17.375
I THINK I MISSED MY SUPER BOWL WINDOW

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:17.833
See?

00:00:20.375 --> 00:00:21.500
Season going poorly?

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:22.708
Panic with us!

00:00:22.708 --> 00:00:24.291
WE BLEW A 17-POINT LEAD?

00:00:24.291 --> 00:00:25.333
Oh, that’s perfect. I’ll take it.

00:00:25.333 --> 00:00:26.583
I talk a lot of s--t

00:00:26.583 --> 00:00:27.750
but my offense f--king sucks

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:28.166
MOTHER

00:00:28.166 --> 00:00:28.916
Oh, I don’t need one

00:00:28.916 --> 00:00:30.916
My brain is sort of like my own panic room

00:00:30.916 --> 00:00:32.125
Our rooms come equipped

00:00:32.125 --> 00:00:33.708
with a place to tweet frustrations

00:00:33.708 --> 00:00:35.333
a schedule to stress about

00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:37.208
WE PLAY THE RAMS AND THE PATS?!

00:00:37.208 --> 00:00:38.916
and podiums for you to insist

00:00:38.916 --> 00:00:40.375
you’re not panicking at

00:00:40.375 --> 00:00:41.708
I actually feel really good

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:42.416
about where we’re at

00:00:42.416 --> 00:00:42.875
Thank you

00:00:44.125 --> 00:00:45.333
What if I just want to give up?

00:00:45.333 --> 00:00:46.291
Luckily for you

00:00:46.291 --> 00:00:47.791
we have “accepted defeat” rooms

00:00:47.791 --> 00:00:48.625
I'M NOT CRYING

00:00:48.625 --> 00:00:49.750
YOU'RE CRYING

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:51.375
Each comes with a Larry Fitzgerald

00:00:51.375 --> 00:00:52.750
to make it all better!

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:53.958
It’s OK if your team is garbage

00:00:53.958 --> 00:00:54.916
as long as everyone loves you!

00:00:54.916 --> 00:00:56.083
God, he’s so classy

00:00:56.083 --> 00:00:57.000
So buy today!

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.291
Because the season isn’t even halfway over

00:00:59.291 --> 00:01:00.000
Ahhh!!!

